# Citation metadata for TCI Research Atlas (https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
# The license below covers the published data (the releases under data/ on the site). The repository has no
# LICENSE file yet, so the code's licence is not stated here.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use figures from TCI Research Atlas, please cite the release you used."
type: dataset
title: "TCI Research Atlas"
abstract: >-
  TCI Research Atlas is a quarterly map of the Thai research landscape built from articles in Thai journals
  indexed by TCI. A batch pipeline groups articles into research topics, marks each topic as emerging, watch,
  hot, declining, stable or low data with a published definition and confidence intervals, and forecasts trends;
  a bilingual (Thai and English) website shows the results for researchers, journal editors and policy makers.
  Only aggregate figures are published: no person names, rankings of people or abstracts.
authors:
  - name: "Thai-Journal Citation Index Centre (TCI)"
keywords:
  - research landscape
  - Thailand
  - Thai journals
  - topic modelling
  - emerging topics
  - bibliometrics
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/santipongth/tci-research-atlas"
version: 2.0.0-p4
date-released: 2026-10-23
